        },
        {
          "text": "Crl.O.P.(MD)N",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1057,
          "end": 1070
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "This criminal original petition has been filed seeking quashment of the FIR in Crime No.24 of 2023 on the file of the 1st respondent police Station.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1082,
      "end": 1230,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crime No.24 of 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1161,
          "end": 1180
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23003767430782318
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "2.The case of the prosecution in brief:-\nThe de-facto complainant lodged a complaint stating that she married one Manivannan in 2004 and they had two children.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1231,
      "end": 1391,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manivannan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1346,
          "end": 1356
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22917386889457703
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Her husband passed away on 21/05/2021 due to Corana.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1392,
      "end": 1444,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "21/05/2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1419,
          "end": 1429
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33034688234329224
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The accused, who is her distant relative asked her to come to his house on 01/01/2022 to go to temple.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1445,
      "end": 1547,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "01/01/2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1520,
          "end": 1530
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33415302634239197
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "When she went to the house of the accused, she was subjected to sexual intercourse for seven times.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1548,
      "end": 1647,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44654592871665955
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Thereafter, the accused and his family members threatened her to make arrangement to marry her elder daughter to the accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1648,
      "end": 1773,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.41098490357398987
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "On the basis of the complaint given by the de-facto complainant, a case in Crime No.24 of 2023 was registered for the offences under sections 376, 354-A, 354-C, 354-D and 506(i) of IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1774,
      "end": 1959,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crime No.24 of 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1849,
          "end": 1868
        },
        {
          "text": "sections 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1907,
          "end": 1919
        },
        {
          "text": "354-A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1921,
          "end": 1926
        },
        {
          "text": "354-C",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1928,
          "end": 1933
        },
        {
          "text": "354-D",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1935,
          "end": 1940
        },
        {
          "text": "506(i)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1945,
          "end": 1951
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1955,
          "end": 1958
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3671662509441376
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "3.Seeking quashment of the same, this petition is filed by the petitioner stating that he has not committed any offence as alleged by the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1960,
      "end": 2111,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23594427108764648
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "4.Heard both sides.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2113,
      "end": 2132,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Crl.O.P.(MD)No.16648 of 2023",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2133,
      "end": 2194,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crl.O.P.(MD)No.16648 of 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2166,
          "end": 2194
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "5.The only ground that has been mentioned in the petition is that it is a consensual relation between the second respondent and this petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2195,
      "end": 2339,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2618078887462616
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Whether, it is consensual in nature or it is a case of rap cannot be a matter for consideration by this court sitting under 482 Cr.P.C jurisdiction.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2340,
      "end": 2488,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C jurisdiction",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2468,
          "end": 2487
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2028539925813675
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "It is purely a factual issue.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2489,
      "end": 2518,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3782828450202942
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "6.In the light of the above said submission, now let us go to the averments made in the complaint.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2519,
      "end": 2618,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.110550157725811
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "7.This petitioner is a close relative of the de- facto complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2619,
      "end": 2687,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25715023279190063
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "She already lost her husband and had two children.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2688,
      "end": 2738,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3589472770690918
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "She was invited to attend a festival.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2739,
      "end": 2776,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3427928388118744
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "On the particular date of occurrence, she went to the house of the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2777,
      "end": 2855,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2590019702911377
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "At that time, she was subjected to frequent intercourse and rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2856,
      "end": 2921,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35119280219078064
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "It is also further alleged that this petitioner alleged to have photographed the incident and used the same for blackmailing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2922,
      "end": 3047,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22525069117546082
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "She was also threatened by the petitioner stating that he will spread the messages.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3048,
      "end": 3131,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20827369391918182
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "After some-time, he has also demanded her daughter to be married to him and by using the Saravanan vs State Rep.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3132,
      "end": 3245,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Saravanan vs State Rep.",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 3222,
          "end": 3245
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12326190620660782
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "By on 18 December, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/79084624/\n2 photographs, she was blackmailing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3246,
      "end": 3360,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18 December, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3252,
          "end": 3269
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3270,
          "end": 3283
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16328361630439758
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "She has also stated that she attempted to commit suicide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3361,
      "end": 3418,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10503711551427841
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Crl.O.P.(MD)No.16648 of 2023 8.What was the relationship between the petitioner and the second respondent, as mentioned above is purely a matter for consideration by the Investigating Officer.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3419,
      "end": 3644,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crl.O.P.(MD)No.16648 of 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3452,
          "end": 3480
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06152563542127609
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "This is too a premature stage to record any finding or observation by this court in this matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3645,
      "end": 3741,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07883092761039734
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "Without any basis or fundamental legal ground, this petition has been filed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3742,
      "end": 3818,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23889900743961334
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "This court is not inclined to entertain this petition.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3819,
      "end": 3873,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.055132027715444565
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "9.In the result, this criminal original petition is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3874,
      "end": 3937,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13874496519565582
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Consequently connected Miscellaneous Petition is closed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3938,
      "end": 3994,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14282269775867462
    },
